      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LIL MISS RIPLEY (2) got off the mark with her maiden victory last time at Capalaba over 366m (19.81). Makes plenty of appeal on the back of that last-start win. IN THE JUNGLE (3) put in a much better performance last start when in the placings at this track behind Hara's Arya (25.74) in a Grade 6. Has the early speed to land on the pace and can stick on. Winning chance. WHERE'S WAL (4) was below best last time finishing fifth at this track, but prior to that had been racing well including a Maiden win two back at Capalaba. Has the ability and can find best this time. LADY SHAZAM (1) is worth consideration after filling a hole at this course and distance last start.",
